BT /F2 13.0 Tf 48.00 321.00 Td (Evaluation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 303.00 Td (The summary table is the evaluation that should be quoted. It has three official development runs and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 290.00 Td (no others. Layer-map numbers in the selection section answer why hidden state 15 was scored. They are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 277.00 Td (not a substitute for the printed row.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.0 Tf 48.00 249.00 Td (Limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 231.00 Td (States are causal, so a token sees only its left context. An empty subword span scores 1, which) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 218.00 Td (inflates a few punctuation tokens. The final layer raises aligned tokens and different tokens together,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 205.00 Td (so a last-layer DiffAlign score looks large and ranks poorly. Italian train, on the per-document map,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 192.00 Td (prefers layer 14 by 0.001. The submitted choice is still layer 15 because validation prefers it in all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 179.00 Td (three languages and the official full-development grade prefers it to layer 8. The unclamped paper) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 166.00 Td (formula was not rerun. 70B was not run. No test score is reported, and the test files must not be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 153.00 Td (passed to the evaluator until the organizers say which split they score.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.0 Tf 48.00 125.00 Td (Reproducibility) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 107.00 Td (The public tree is https://github.com/moscraciunxxx/SpanDiff-HackApertus. From a checkout of this tree,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 94.00 Td (make run-local grades predictions/dev with --split dev and does not load the model. make predict writes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 81.00 Td (a new layer-15 development run under predictions/rerun. It needs the Apertus weights and a Hugging Face) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 68.00 Td (token only if those weights are not cached. The Docker image grades the same committed development) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 55.00 Td (files. It was built and graded under podman on linux/amd64. Docker is not installed on this Mac, so) Tj ET
